body:
### Tested versions

- Reproducible in: 4.7.2.stable, 4.7.2.stable.mono, 4.8.dev7.mono

### System information

Godot v4.7.2.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)

### Issue description

Calling `EditorInspector.instantiate_property_editor()` freezes the engine and results in multiple `Stack underflow!` errors. In C# it plainly crashes the engine.

I'm curious if I'm doing something very wrong here, like some infinite recursion? Although it seems it would defeat the purpose of the function. 

Implementations:

```gdscript
class_name PluginInspector extends EditorInspectorPlugin

func _can_handle(object: Object) -> bool:
	return true

func _parse_property(object: Object, type: Variant.Type, name: String, hint_type: PropertyHint, hint_string: String, usage_flags: int, wide: bool) -> bool:
	# causes stack underflow
	add_custom_control(EditorInspector.instantiate_property_editor(object, type, name, hint_type, hint_string, usage_flags, wide))
	return true
``` 

```c#
public partial class PluginInspector : EditorInspectorPlugin
{
    public override bool _CanHandle(GodotObject @object)
    {
        return true;
    }

    public override bool _ParseProperty(GodotObject @object, Variant.Type type, string name, PropertyHint hintType, string hintString, PropertyUsageFlags usageFlags, bool wide)
    {
        // Crashes the engine
        AddCustomControl(EditorInspector.InstantiatePropertyEditor(@object, type, name, hintType, hintString, (uint)usageFlags, wide));
        return true;
    }
}
``` 

The issue still occurs if instantiate_property_editor is called on a single line, or if used with "add_child".

### Steps to reproduce

* Open the MRP
* Select the Node3D

This also crashes on opening ProjectSettings. It uses a plugin that can be disabled by manually editing project.godot. The MRP has the gdscript plugin enabled (stack underflow), and contains a similar c# implem.

### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)

MRP: [instantiate_editor_property.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33062132/instantiate_editor_property.zip)
